     "texto": [
      "**Kakek** means grandfather and **nenek** means grandmother. **Paman**, **bibi** and **sepupu** mean uncle, aunt and cousin."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Possession with a suffix",
     "texto": [
      "**Ibuku** means \"my mother\" and **nenekmu**, \"your grandmother\". The suffix is written attached to the noun."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Birth order",
     "texto": [
      "**Anak keberapa?** asks \"which child are you?\" **Kesatu** means first and **kedua**, second."
